'''Ghost''' is a [[Vintage Weapons|vintage]] knife that was originally purchasable from the shop in [[Murder Mystery|Murder Mystery 1]] for 1200 Points {{Currency|Point}} or 20 Cash {{Currency|Cash}}. It is currently only obtainable through trading. 

==Appearance==
The Ghost knife has a spearhead like blade being a tealish-white color. On this knife, there is no guard, instead it has this blackish grey tape surrounding the bottom part being its 'handle', as it resembles a dagger with a clear light blue blade and a black handle. Some of the tang is still visible on this weapon, making the handle of the weapon too short to fully surround the tang.

==Trivia==
*It used to give you the ability to throw knifes easier and faster, similar to the [[Sleight]] [[Powers|power]] before Murder Mystery was renamed to Murder Mystery 2.
*Some players love this [[Knives|knife]] because it can be easily be hidden behind the [[Teddy Bear|teddy bear]] [[Emotes|emote]]. The way this is done is by equipping your teddy bear, and then equipping your knife using the "equip" button instead of the knife button in your inventory.
* Ghost's model and texture originates from the Roblox gear [https://www.roblox.com/catalog/64220952/Ghostfire-Throwing-Daggers Ghostfire Throwing Daggers].
*Ghost is currently the smallest and shortest knife in the game.
*Ghost is one of the ten weapons in the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Vintage Set|Vintage Set]], the others being: [[Shadow]], [[Phaser]], [[Golden]], [[America (Vintage)|America]], [[Blood]], [[Splitter]], [[Laser (Vintage)|Laser]], [[Prince]], and [[Cowboy]].
*There was a few bugs that were related to Ghost, which gave this knife a big hype. Most popular is [[Mil-Base]] bug, where you could be able to jump highly, if you bump into tank and jump. These bugs are patched now.
*It has a [[Ghost Gun (Uncommon)|partner gun]] under the same name.

